    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**12 Month Lease***\n\n***Inclusive Utilities - Electricity, water, heat, high-speed WiFi, and refuse included in rent ***\n\nVisit www.dxlivingdonnybrook.ie for more information\n\nDiscover DX Living Donnybrook, an exciting new rental development of stylish studio apartments with extensive amenities designed for comfortable, urban living. Located in the heart of Donnybrook, one of Dublin's most desirable areas, these studios combine contemporary style and convenience\n.\nWhat's Included:\n\n• Studio Apartment - Your own space with double bed, ensuite bathroom, kitchenette with hob & fridge, and smart storage.\n\n• Inclusive Utilities - Electricity, water, heat, high-speed WiFi, and refuse included in rent.\n\n• Residents' Amenities - Stunning lounges, co-working areas, communal kitchens, games room, rooftop garden, and bike storage.\n\n• Community - Join an exciting new community with shared spaces and interests.\n\n• On-site Concierge & Security\n\n• Additional Services Available - Optional bed linen, plates, and cutlery for easy move-in.\n\nPrime Location: DX Living is in vibrant Donnybrook, with local shops, cafes, and dining options nearby. Herbert Park is just steps away, perfect for outdoor activities, and Raw Gyms Donnybrook is next door. Donnybrook Mall and Donnybrook Fair are only a few minutes away, providing everyday essentials and gourmet groceries.\n\nConvenient Transport: Over six bus routes, including the 46A, 39A, and 145, offer quick connections to Dublin city centre (just 10 minutes). The Aircoach to Dublin Airport stops nearby every 30 minutes. Grand Canal Dock is only a 9-minute cycle away.\n\nEnquire now to receive viewing details."
      },
